    "rendered": "Rural Hackers &#8211; A movement for the revitalization of rural life"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-b7f6f8cb wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:70%\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading alignwide has-text-align-left has-accent-1-color has-text-color has-link-color has-inter-font-family wp-elements-f0779a998e3cd981240dd9d0fc0f537f\" style=\"font-size:9vw;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:0.9\"><strong>Rural Hackers</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-accent-1-color has-text-color has-link-color has-offbit-trial-font-family wp-elements-ac2d277d5ca0d626fecf9774a2c87208 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-size:clamp(18.959px, 1.185rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 1.082), 30px);text-transform:uppercase\">A movement for the revitalization of <strong>rural life</strong> //</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:56%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" data-src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Ilustracion_sin_titulo-1-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Mapa Anceu\" class=\"wp-image-473 lazyload\"/><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1810\" height=\"2560\" src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Ilustracion_sin_titulo-1-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Mapa Anceu\" class=\"wp-image-473 lazyload\" srcset=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Ilustracion_sin_titulo-1-scaled.jpg 1810w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Ilustracion_sin_titulo-1-212x300.jpg 212w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Ilustracion_sin_titulo-1-724x1024.jpg 724w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Ilustracion_sin_titulo-1-768x1086.jpg 768w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Ilustracion_sin_titulo-1-1086x1536.jpg 1086w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Ilustracion_sin_titulo-1-1448x2048.jpg 1448w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1810px) 100vw, 1810px\" /></noscript></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull is-style-section-1 has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-75f56b9d wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained is-style-section-1--73\" style=\"min-height:0vh;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-f15145cb wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Rural Hackers</h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Rural Hackers is an international organization dedicated to fostering innovation and creativity at the intersection of technology, rural living and art. We provide a platform for interdisciplinary collaboration, empowering people to challenge traditional thinking and create groundbreaking projects that inspire positive change.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Rural Hackers</strong>&nbsp;is based on the power of inspiration. Our aim is to create a place where you can find people who become your reference for change.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull is-style-default has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--80);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--80)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-f911b2ec wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);flex-basis:45%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" data-src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-37-24.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-353 lazyload\"/><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"979\" src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-37-24.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-353 lazyload\" srcset=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-37-24.png 750w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-37-24-230x300.png 230w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" /></noscript></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:-12vw\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignright size-full is-resized\" style=\"margin-right:-5vw;margin-left:-5vw\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" data-src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-29-52.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-378 lazyload\" style=\"width:202px\"/><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"470\" height=\"677\" src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-29-52.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-378 lazyload\" style=\"width:202px\" srcset=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-29-52.png 470w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-29-52-208x300.png 208w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 470px) 100vw, 470px\" /></noscript></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-right:0;padding-left:0;flex-basis:50%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-831b2db5 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-text-annotation has-offbit-trial-font-family is-style-text-annotation--74\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">The Context</h2>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-text-subtitle is-style-text-subtitle--75 wp-block-paragraph\">Rural areas of Galicia (Spain) are becoming severely depopulated. This fact jeopardizes a way of living, endangers a whole tradition, and disconnects us from our roots.We envision technology, arts and creativity as twisters. They can bring steamy change to rural areas and help to build new ecosystems.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull is-style-section-1 has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained is-style-section-1--76\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-6108e6a5 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:60%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-horizontal is-content-justification-left is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-58daf81f wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"min-height:100%\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-text-annotation has-offbit-trial-font-family is-style-text-annotation--77\" style=\"font-size:14px;text-transform:uppercase\">This is our motto</h2>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-style-plain has-x-large-font-size is-layout-flow wp-container-core-quote-is-layout-a54b8880 wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow is-style-plain--78\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-232e6632 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-size:clamp(1.743rem, 1.743rem + ((1vw - 0.2rem) * 1.972), 3rem);line-height:1.2\">“You can make a&nbsp;<strong>difference</strong><br>You can always&nbsp;<strong>contribute</strong><br>Let’s make this happen&nbsp;<strong>together</strong>”<br></p>\n</div>\n<cite>Rosario<br><sub>Anceu, Ponte Caldelas</sub></cite></blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full wp-duotone-unset-79\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" data-src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-33-22.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-366 lazyload\"/><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"476\" height=\"679\" src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-33-22.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-366 lazyload\" srcset=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-33-22.png 476w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-33-22-210x300.png 210w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 476px) 100vw, 476px\" /></noscript></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull is-style-default has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-d6401b07 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center is-style-text-annotation has-offbit-trial-font-family is-style-text-annotation--80\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">Stuff we do</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-794e3cfa wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" data-src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-35-37.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-359 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\"/><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"739\" height=\"949\" src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-35-37.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-359 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-35-37.png 739w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-35-37-234x300.png 234w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 739px) 100vw, 739px\" /></noscript></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-offbit-trial-font-family\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">Creative Residencies</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">One-month experience at Anceu coliving to develop projects on tech, arts or creativity. </p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-35f06ea7 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://ruralhackers.com/rural-hackers-residencies/\">Learn more</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" data-src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-28-59.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-381 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\"/><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"754\" height=\"973\" src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-28-59.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-381 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-28-59.png 754w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-28-59-232x300.png 232w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 754px) 100vw, 754px\" /></noscript></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-offbit-trial-font-family\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">Rural Digital Projects</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">We develop open source tech solutions to fight against rural challenges</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-35f06ea7 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://ruralhackers.com/rural-digital-projects/\">Learn more</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" data-src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-34-27.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-361 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\"/><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"475\" height=\"674\" src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-34-27.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-361 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-34-27.png 475w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-34-27-211x300.png 211w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" /></noscript></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-offbit-trial-font-family\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">Sharing Knowledge Events </h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Monthly initiatives to learn traditional and innovative knowledge. </p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-35f06ea7 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://ruralhackers.com/sharing-knowledge-events/\">Learn more</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-accent-5-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading alignwide has-text-align-left is-style-default\" style=\"font-size:clamp(4.371rem, 4.371rem + ((1vw - 0.2rem) * 8.202), 9.6rem);\">Our hackers</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-794e3cfa wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-default\">We build trough the power of the local villagers of Anceu and our international community. Together, we create a future where every person&#8217;s effort leads to lasting impact.</h2>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-58d222ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" data-src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-31-36.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-372 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\"/><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"751\" height=\"946\" src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-31-36.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-372 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-31-36.png 751w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-31-36-238x300.png 238w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 751px) 100vw, 751px\" /></noscript></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" data-src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-34-36.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-360 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\"/><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"739\" height=\"949\" src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-34-36.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-360 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-34-36.png 739w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-34-36-234x300.png 234w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 739px) 100vw, 739px\" /></noscript></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" data-src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-33-58.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-363 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\"/><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"742\" height=\"980\" src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-33-58.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-363 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-33-58.png 742w, https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Screenshot-from-2025-02-17-14-33-58-227x300.png 227w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 742px) 100vw, 742px\" /></noscript></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" data-src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/DSC02753.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-331 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\"/><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"648\" height=\"972\" src=\"https://ruralhackers.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/DSC02753.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-331 lazyload\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https://ruralhackers.